HG-Bench reference integration

This integration includes LDBC SNB Interactive v1 implementation sources from
commit 11db98cc2ba14c33492f6c0c34e68c8be7e22e5f. Their original LICENSE.txt and
NOTICE.txt are retained in upstream/ and in the compiled reference jar.

HG-Bench applies the separately recorded compatibility-overlay.json at build
time. It changes IC3 xCount, yCount and count extraction from Java int to long
to match the selected LDBC driver's 64-bit result contract. Query text and
query semantics are unchanged. The upstream source files remain unmodified.

Dependency jars retain their upstream licensing metadata. The distribution
uses explicit dependency and content locks; it does not resolve mutable Maven
versions during the reference build.
